        'In insertion sort, `current` is saved before the loop because the first shift overwrites its slot. `a[j + 1] = current` drops it into the gap when the loop stops, either because a value was not larger or because `j` fell below 0.',
        'Counting inside the loops is how we turned the Big O claims into numbers: the table above came from running these three functions on the four inputs.',
